  "title": "Build agentic apps in minutes with Rayfin and Microsoft Fabric",
  "description": "Build an enterprise app in minutes with Rayfin, an agent-friendly, code-first backend-as-a-service. In this demo, we show how an AI agent generates a full stack web app with a managed database, authentication, and backend services. Learn how to connect the app to existing data in your Microsoft Fabric data estate, define services in code, and use Fabric’s built-in analytics, BI, and AI capabilities to power insights and intelligent experiences.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
